<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Identify</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Conjurer (guild level 11), Sorcerer (guild level 12)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast identify &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Tells you what an object is and what it does. It works on things in the room, 
in your inventory, or that you wear. You learn, depending on the object:
</p>
<ul><li>a weapon's fighting style, and how good its craftsmanship and magic are,</li>
<li>an armour's kind, and how good its craftsmanship and magic are,</li>
<li>a light's hours left and how bright it is,</li>
<li>the power of a potion, scroll, wand or staff, and its charges left,</li>
<li>whether food or drink is poisoned,</li>
<li>every bonus the object gives you while you wear it: abilities, spells,</li></ul>
<pre> skills, light or sanctuary.
</pre>
<p>For the exact numbers, the spells stored in potions, scrolls, wands and 
staffs, and which race a weapon slays, see <a cmd='#'>Help Improved Identify</a>.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Improved Identify</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Evaluate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>